{"id":"L01","producer_id":"06CE905146294CED1250B91A97D8680D","language":"en","text":"The rains came late two years in a row and the coffee flowers dropped before they could set.","labeler_a":["climate and weather","water"],"labeler_b":["climate and weather","water"],"reference":["climate and weather","water"]}
{"id":"L02","producer_id":"13122A9272AC392019A6D3DC27784E39","language":"es","text":"El calor de este año fue peor que nunca y la tierra ya no produce como antes.","labeler_a":["climate and weather","soil and land"],"labeler_b":["climate and weather","soil and land"],"reference":["climate and weather","soil and land"]}
{"id":"L03","producer_id":"128C174E522127561CF633C0D5BFF01C","language":"en","text":"The well dried up and there is no pipe to the fields, so the women now walk an hour to fetch water.","labeler_a":["water","infrastructure"],"labeler_b":["water","infrastructure"],"reference":["water","infrastructure"]}
{"id":"L04","producer_id":"0BC50AE964D0E434176AD9B88DA7BE47","language":"es","text":"Se nos está lavando la tierra de las parcelas en ladera y además nos pagan muy poco por la cosecha.","labeler_a":["soil and land","market and price"],"labeler_b":["soil and land"],"reference":["soil and land","market and price"]}
{"id":"L05","producer_id":"104731E2F9439502969FAC6F2783D888","language":"en","text":"Buyers pay us a quarter less per kilo, and we still owe the loan we took for inputs.","labeler_a":["market and price","financial and access to capital"],"labeler_b":["market and price","financial and access to capital"],"reference":["market and price","financial and access to capital"]}
{"id":"L06","producer_id":"95A4A8BC3F2E3F38F8D6A81B57BA5E4A","language":"es","text":"Los intermediarios bajaron el precio y no hay quién coseche porque los jóvenes se fueron.","labeler_a":["market and price"],"labeler_b":["market and price","labor and migration"],"reference":["market and price","labor and migration"]}
{"id":"L07","producer_id":"0F0B3837DB56741F8FE33D6009F930FB","language":"en","text":"Young people are leaving for the city and the community feels it at every harvest.","labeler_a":["labor and migration","social and community"],"labeler_b":["labor and migration","social and community"],"reference":["labor and migration","social and community"]}
{"id":"L08","producer_id":"CED2DEE8ED99922FA5C6244DEF177AF3","language":"es","text":"Faltan jornaleros y ninguno sabe podar ni llevar registros de la finca.","labeler_a":["labor and migration","education"],"labeler_b":["labor and migration","education"],"reference":["labor and migration","education"]}
{"id":"L09","producer_id":"074EA1F7E1D099B788D6E441E846D06E","language":"en","text":"The bank will not lend us to renew the farm because we have no land titles, and the warehouse is too small.","labeler_a":["financial and access to capital","infrastructure"],"labeler_b":["financial and access to capital","infrastructure","social and community"],"reference":["financial and access to capital","infrastructure"]}
{"id":"L10","producer_id":"06E573CEA2E08D37FDA6E3C683CD6BEE","language":"es","text":"Las mujeres decimos que nuestras ideas para el Premium nunca se toman en cuenta y nadie nos capacita.","labeler_a":["education","social and community"],"labeler_b":["education","social and community"],"reference":["education","social and community"]}
{"id":"L11","producer_id":"9D79CF4ED3FBE4CFBD3640576B74642A","language":"en","text":"Several workers got sick after spraying without protection, and there is no clinic in the village.","labeler_a":["health","infrastructure"],"labeler_b":["health","infrastructure"],"reference":["health","infrastructure"]}
{"id":"L12","producer_id":"0EE8D264D111FB5D78D7A4295495AAE1","language":"es","text":"Cuando alguien se enferma hay que viajar a la ciudad, y la comunidad no tiene dónde pedir ayuda.","labeler_a":["health","social and community"],"labeler_b":["health","social and community"],"reference":["health","social and community"]}
{"id":"L13","producer_id":"1978416593265821B2A50DA5DEDF4B9D","language":"en","text":"People from outside are cutting the forest next to our farms, and the bees and birds are gone.","labeler_a":["biodiversity and conservation","social and community"],"labeler_b":["biodiversity and conservation"],"reference":["biodiversity and conservation","social and community"]}
{"id":"L14","producer_id":"24808A1AC63F325714A31BF64FCCF91D","language":"es","text":"Ya casi no se ven abejas en los cafetales y el arroyo que regaba se está secando.","labeler_a":["biodiversity and conservation","water"],"labeler_b":["biodiversity and conservation","water"],"reference":["biodiversity and conservation","water"]}
{"id":"L15","producer_id":"CFC19603C1B7B29C017954FD1DB2D620","language":"en","text":"There are divisions in the association and the road to the collection centre is impassable in the rains.","labeler_a":["social and community","infrastructure"],"labeler_b":["social and community","infrastructure"],"reference":["social and community","infrastructure"]}
